# Cloudflare Web Analytics beacon token
# Get it at: dash.cloudflare.com -> account home -> Analytics & Services -> Web Analytics -> Add site -> Manual setup
# Copy the long hex string from the "token" field of the snippet.
# For local builds put it in .env (gitignored); for production add PUBLIC_CF_BEACON_TOKEN as an
# environment variable in the Cloudflare Pages project settings (Build & deploy -> Environment variables).
# If unset, the analytics script is simply not rendered.
PUBLIC_CF_BEACON_TOKEN=
